&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👐&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt; About the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Head of Legal supports Alma to grow safely and sustainably by anticipating and managing legal risk, providing pragmatic advice, negotiating contracts, and supporting teams across the company; in a strongly regulated environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Head of Legal&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;reports to Alma’s General Secretary and lead the Legal function. You will be a trusted partner to the Director’s Committee and work closely with Product, Tech, Sales, Operations, Finance, Risk, Compliance, Information Security and People.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also act as Alma’s Data Protection Officer, with the independence, resources and direct access to senior management required to perform the role effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a permanent position based in Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💼 About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Head of Legal, you will define Alma’s legal and privacy strategy and ensure that it supports the company’s business ambitions, regulatory obligations and risk appetite.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your main responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and lead Alma’s legal strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute a clear legal roadmap aligned with Alma’s business and international strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, assess and manage Alma’s main legal risks, escalating material matters to executive management and governance bodies when appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear, pragmatic and business-oriented advice to the Executive Committee and teams across Alma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex legal requirements into actionable recommendations, policies and scalable operational processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor relevant legal developments across Alma’s markets and anticipate their impact on the company’s products and activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Alma’s business, products and partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise Product and Tech teams throughout the design and launch of new products and features, embedding legal and privacy considerations from the outset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Sales, Account Management, Operations and other business teams on strategic projects and complex legal questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the drafting, review and negotiation of commercial agreements, including agreements with merchants, partners, suppliers and technology providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish scalable contracting standards, templates, playbooks and approval processes that enable teams to move quickly while controlling legal risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on strategic transactions, partnerships, outsourcing arrangements and international expansion projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oversee corporate and governance matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Alma’s corporate legal matters and ensure that its legal entities comply with applicable governance and corporate requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support executive management and governance bodies in preparing decisions and maintaining appropriate corporate documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on financing, corporate transactions, intellectual property, competition law and other strategic legal matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate external counsel and manage the legal budget, ensuring that external expertise is used effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee litigation, pre-litigation, claims and other disputes, defining the appropriate strategy and protecting Alma’s interests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as Alma’s Data Protection Officer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and oversee Alma’s data protection framework in accordance with the GDPR and other applicable privacy laws.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inform and advise Alma and its employees on their data protection obligations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor compliance through appropriate policies, processes, controls and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and continuously improve Alma’s privacy governance, including records of processing activities, privacy notices, retention standards and procedures for handling data-subject requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a robust framework for data protection impact assessments and ensure that DPIAs are conducted when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise Product, Tech, Data, Risk, Operations, Marketing and People teams on privacy-by-design and privacy-by-default principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Information Security on personal-data breaches, incident response, security measures and regulatory notifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as Alma’s primary contact for data protection authorities and cooperate with them when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop training and awareness initiatives to foster a strong data protection culture throughout Alma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop the Legal team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set a clear vision, priorities and operating model for the Legal team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, coach and develop team members, promoting high standards of expertise, ownership and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Allocate resources according to business priorities and ensure that legal requests are handled effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define meaningful objectives and indicators to measure the team’s impact, service quality and risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships across Alma and position Legal as both a strategic partner and an independent control function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧩 About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You combine excellent legal judgment with a strong understanding of business. You are comfortable taking clear positions on complex matters while remaining pragmatic and solution-oriented.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are likely to thrive in this role if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can move comfortably between strategic questions and hands-on legal work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand how to balance business velocity, customer experience, innovation and legal risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate complex legal matters clearly to both legal and non-legal audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior leaders and challenge decisions constructively when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy developing people and creating clarity for a multidisciplinary team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable working with incomplete information and taking ownership of sensitive or high-impact decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong negotiation, drafting and stakeholder-management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are fluent in both French and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your experience&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold a Master’s degree in law or an equivalent legal qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have significant experience in senior legal positions (15+ years), combining experience in a leading bank or FinTech and a law firm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong expertise in banking, commercial and technology contracts, corporate matters and business law.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting international activities and working across several European jurisdictions would also be valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the level of expertise and professional standing required to act as Data Protection Officer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Hiring process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because of the strategic importance of this role, the recruitment process will be thorough while remaining as efficient as possible. It is expected to include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An introductory conversation with the Talent Acquisition team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interview with the General Secretary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical case study focused on legal strategy, business partnering and data protection with key members of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meetings with key members of Alma’s leadership and relevant cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interview with one of our co-founders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
